                </p>
                <div class="pt-1.5 border-t border-zinc-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs min-h-[36px]">
                  <a href="tel:09660646673" class="font-semibold text-zinc-700 hover:text-brand-mint inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 py-1">
